{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act26side_level_act26side_03_beg",
  "groupId": "act26side",
  "stageId": "act26side_03",
  "title": "豈可空手回天府？",
  "storyCode": "HE-3",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act26side/level_act26side_03_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "4f899236dab6c1b882c344074f183ffa38fef491becdcd580528ce1941612285",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "這是一種難以形容的感覺。\n額頭上傳來古怪的癢意，頭頂的光環不穩定地明滅。\n眼前的一切都逐漸開始變得黯淡。\n福爾圖娜能看到老邁的主教難以置信的雙眼，她能聽到周圍嘈雜的人聲。\n但當她像之前每一次那樣，試圖感受面前的老人的想法，對方的心情卻無法再流入她的心靈，一絲一毫也不能——\n她感受不到其他薩科塔了。\n她已不再是他們之中的一員。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "39_g7_chapel"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_924_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "墮天......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_924_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是什麼意思......福爾圖娜她會怎麼樣？她、她是病了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個回頭再解釋，先處理眼下最要緊的問題——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斯特凡諾爺爺......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "救救菲娜！求您了，快、快救救她......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "孩子，不要慌，好好說......到底是怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "菲娜、菲娜流了好多血，我怎麼也止不住......我找不到人幫忙......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們只是、只是吵了一架，菲娜要我的守護銃，我該給她的，我為什麼不給她？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都是我不好......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別怕，別怕，孩子，別害怕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從現有的情況判斷，我認為這是一場不包含主觀加害意圖的意外傷害事件。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "住口！執行者！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在指控這個孩子......傷害了她的同胞？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你竟敢做出這種指控——？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......這是最合理的推測。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "戒律帶來的排斥並非無法克服，無意走火的狀況更是時有發生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......一派胡言！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不......他說得對......是我，是我扣了扳機！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "福爾圖娜！可你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......斯特凡諾爺爺，是我的錯，要怎麼懲罰我都可以！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是菲娜還在......她受傷了！求您救救菲娜！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，好，我現在就去——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "急救我擅長，告訴我在什麼地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就在、就在我的房間......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_924_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我可以帶路！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拜託你了，克萊芒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "少說廢話，快點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "39_g10_monasterycorridor_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_924_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在這邊，請跟我來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_924_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到了，就是這裡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_924_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "門沒有關上......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "39_g9_monasteryroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_924_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好多血......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_924_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "德爾菲娜！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小點聲！你想讓所有人都知道這裡出事了嗎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓開，讓我看看！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不行。傷勢太嚴重，血止不住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且她的傷......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_924_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在該怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_924_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "花......對了！我記得主教閣下說過聖堂的花也能當藥用！對，對，一定能......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_924_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我這就去摘！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_924_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別攔著我！立刻、立刻去的話，也許還來得及——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去了也沒用！就算止住血，也來不及了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_924_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼意思？怎麼會沒用......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在極近距離中彈，大量失血，探查不到鼻息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我試了急救，但沒什麼效果，她的心跳沒能恢復。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_924_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有呼吸......也沒有心跳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很大可能是一擊斃命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這女孩已經死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "39_g7_chapel"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我把大門關上了，好在附近沒有其他人，應該沒有多少目擊者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在要怎麼處理？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等待斯普莉雅的處理結果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "墮天使的光環產生色變，她墮天的速度很快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為修道院內部的穩定考慮，我的建議是：立刻取消布道，對內封鎖這一消息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我有一個提議。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為避免發生不必要的衝突，接下來一段時間，由我與我的同僚接管這裡的巡邏工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所有居民應當儘快回到各自房間，等待明日的最終決議。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這可以最大限度地確保不再發生其他意外事件。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......執行者閣下，在修道院的歸屬尚未落定前，這裡還不是拉特蘭的領土！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我很清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......修道院內部的問題我們自會解決，不敢勞動拉特蘭的客人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "執行者閣下也說了，這只是一場意外事故，德爾菲娜現在如何尚不確定，一切可能只是虛驚一場......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不論是否是意外，她已經墮天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "墮天使相關問題必須由教宗閣下與樞機團親自判斷並處理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你要將這孩子帶回拉特蘭，可我從未在拉特蘭城中見過頭生雙角的薩科塔，從未！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說，執行者閣下，這要我如何能夠相信你所謂的處理？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個......費德里科，我稍微提醒一下，教宗閣下是不是說要你注意點，別鬧出太大矛盾來著？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼？我沒有製造矛盾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，好吧。我的意思是......嗯，你的方式可以再稍微緩和一點......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我不理解你的意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是感謝你的提議。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......唉，算了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我覺得......在這裡爭論也不會有結果。既然我們暫時不會離開，不如先找個地方讓這位，嗯，福爾圖娜小姐稍微休息一會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等搞清楚具體情況，大家都稍微平靜一些，再來商量具體的解決辦法也不遲嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "主教閣下也不必對拉特蘭這麼沒有信心，類似的例子之前也不是沒有過，只要確實不是惡意違反戒律，應該還是不會受太重責罰的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對吧，費德里科？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對。但這不屬於你有權限透露的情報，里凱萊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "特殊情況，特殊情況。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "兩位都考慮一下？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒有意見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......斯特凡諾爺爺，別說了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是我的錯......不論什麼樣的處罰，我都會接受......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "福爾圖娜！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我跟你走，這位先生......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就這麼定了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我送福爾圖娜小姐去休息，兩位就在這裡冷靜一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "39_g9_monasteryroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡的房間看起來還不錯。呃......很寬敞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要太擔心，你的事情比較特殊，教宗閣下應該會親自過問。只要不是故意傷人，應該不會太嚴重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......菲娜她......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "菲娜，是那位......受傷的薩科塔公民？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "目前還不能確定對方的狀態，我的同事應該已經在處理了。往好處想，或許沒有那麼嚴重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的角......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼我會長出這樣的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和薩卡茲一樣的角......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個啊，其實我也不那麼清楚......總之，等到了拉特蘭會有人告訴你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "暫時就在這裡好好休息吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會待在門外，如果有什麼問題，可以敲門喊我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "39_g10_monasterycorridor_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉......不知道費德里科會怎麼處理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你知道嗎，其實我還是個挺敏感的人來著。如果有人鬼鬼祟祟地躲在我背後，我會忍不住流冷汗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別藏了，出來吧，奧倫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_355_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能問一句嗎，你是怎麼發現我的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其實我只是想詐你一下，沒想到你真的會出現。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_355_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你指望我會相信這話？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼不呢？左右我也不虧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_355_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算了吧，里凱萊，你這個騙子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別這麼說，至少我比斯普莉雅要更誠實。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斯普莉雅是你那邊的人對吧，她說了謊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不......也不能算是說謊，她只是沒有把話說全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_355_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這話從何談起？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之前在問到和你有關的問題時，她只說“懶得管你”，沒給出其他任何資訊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她在回避費德里科的問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_355_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......就憑這個，你就判定她說了謊？一般人不會這麼想吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可能是因為我也挺擅長這麼幹。而且，看看這裡的情況，很容易就能猜到你會怎麼行動，我猜費德里科應該也猜到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_355_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難纏的傢伙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_355_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我果然還是該找個時間拉他喝一杯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然後被他押送回教皇廳？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_355_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這座修道院裡的客人比你想的還要大牌得多。到時候費德里科不一定還有心思抓我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......聽起來這裡的麻煩真不少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，奧倫，你和斯普莉雅的計劃具體是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_355_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽了我的計劃，你就會幫我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個嘛......不一定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這要等我先聽了才能決定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "39_g7_chapel"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "費德里科，有個壞消息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "呃......等會，現在你旁邊有其他人嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "里凱萊不在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "誰管他在不在！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "我是問......那個叫福爾圖娜的女孩在旁邊嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不在。里凱萊已經將她送往住宿區。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你有任何發現，請說。我需要確認受到攻擊的公民的生理狀態。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "......行，那我直說了——我們到的時候已經太遲了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "確認死亡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "確認。是銃造成的致命傷。除非真有奇蹟，否則沒可能起死回生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "對了，和我一起來的那位叫克萊芒的先生，他說要去摘點花，我沒管他，隨他去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "那傢伙走的時候失魂落魄的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "花？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "就是那個資料裡說的修道院特產。現在好像沒剩多少了，不重要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "這件事確實是個意外，費德里科，那姑娘沒說謊。銃走火。這事......或許沒那麼嚴重......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "教宗閣下會判斷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "好吧......就連莫斯提馬那樣的都沒事，我相信我們的教宗閣下會一如既往地寬厚仁慈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "一會我會聯繫里凱萊讓他愛去哪就去哪，那姑娘我來盯著，不會讓她到處亂跑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "至於蕾繆安和奧倫那邊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奧倫·亞吉奧拉斯是否已與你取得聯繫？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "......你是在懷疑我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "依我判斷，是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奧倫的行動並沒有受到限制，沒有與教皇廳取得聯絡是他的主觀行為。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "事情牽扯到薩卡茲，我推測奧倫不會直接離開這裡，如果他想要有所行動，一定會需要取得配合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "所以你懷疑到我頭上......但里凱萊呢？你不懷疑？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "里凱萊單獨行動的時間沒有你充足。他的嫌疑程度在你之下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "哈哈哈，你真聰明，費德里科。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "我的回答是：拒絕回答。這些都是你自己猜的，我可什麼都沒說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "那就這樣，回頭再聯繫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "哦對了，那位主教閣下在嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "呃......剛剛的消息要和他再說一遍嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他已經聽到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......德爾菲娜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我必須要親自去確認。我得去......看看那孩子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "閣下有行動的自由。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但斯普莉雅不會判斷錯誤，我不推薦額外耗費時間再去確認。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "初步推測奧倫·亞吉奧拉斯仍停留在此，並有所謀劃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在我需要詳細瞭解他失蹤前，於修道院內停留期間的所有行動，以及近期修道院人員往來情況，請你配合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "執行者閣下，於你而言，何為必要？你要如何區分必要與否？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你當真聽不見同胞的慟哭？情感於你真就如此不值一提？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我不否認。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "若真是如此，你不配為樂園之先驅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "若你代表拉特蘭......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼，拉特蘭不配為我所信仰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請閣下回答我的問題：奧倫在修道院內是否有異常舉動？近期是否有他人在修道院內停留？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我與你已無話好說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請自便吧，執行者閣下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "39_g9_monasteryroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看完了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這麼厚的一本手記，虧他真的用完了最後一頁紙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "蕾繆安舒了一口氣，合上面前陳舊的素色筆記本。\n女人的手指劃過封皮上那些藏著一段段故事的摩擦痕跡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果當初......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......哎呀，我在想什麼呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好啦，接下來......嗯，我也該行動起來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斯普莉雅他們都已經來了，可不能再拖拖拉拉下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有人在外面嗎？如果有事找我的話，可以直接進來沒關係。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "扭曲的怪物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_930_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......哎呀，沒想到會是這樣的客人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不好意思，這位客人，你來得不是時候——現在沒有茶水可以招待你呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
